 * dmem_cgroup_pool_state_put() - Drop a reference to a dmem_cgroup_pool_state
 * @pool: &dmem_cgroup_pool_state
 *
 * Called to drop a reference to the limiting pool returned by
 * dmem_cgroup_try_charge().
